      }
    },
    "assembly_sha256": "cbafbc4d89bda99a982f45f3f2324282ed433c8c7f6fd7baa5cb61f77fce4083",
    "interpretation": "Semantic tests check pointer transfers and a reachable cycle. They neither observe tri-colour states nor prove barrier correctness or exact GC interleavings. StoreLocal can be optimized away; no-barrier codegen is not a universal promise for all stack writes."
